  "limits_and_deviations": [
    "Private experimental selection only. No installed-runtime change, deployment, publication or new GPU authority.",
    "Frozen benchmark verdict remains INCONCLUSIVE_PARK: C1 verify-round rate +3.9096%, below the unchanged 5% worth-further-effort threshold. Owner selection is a separate judgement.",
    "One baseline-first start per arm; sampled generated work and acceptance differ. The +8.37% C1 and +12.56% C2 observations are not matched-token causal speedups.",
    "BetterBench has no answer-quality oracle. Operation232 quality results cover rollback, not a new quality qualification of split-K.",
    "Startup comparisons show no observed value differences over 31,457,280 elements; signed zeros are treated as equal. Exact-oracle readout passes 1,152 cells; no universal bitwise or cross-shape claim.",
    "Split-K adds 1,310,720 bytes (1.25 MiB) of preallocated FP32 scratch per card and an additional reducer launch per eligible GEMM. Allocator observations are not peak VRAM.",
    "Executed compiler artifacts differ from the native compile proof on both ranks. Debug-source paths are a hypothesis only; retain the actual executed hashes and do not call proof/runtime binaries identical.",
    "Scope is down/out logical N5120, K8704 or K3072, M8/M16, S4, including rare prefill calls at those row counts; other shapes keep the selected route.",
    "Preserve cap16, prefetch/F1/gate-up wave0, BF16 target/draft KV, cap3/LLVM_PATH deviations and mandatory startup numerical gates.",
    "Operation234 nonce is consumed; no retry. Programme remains parked until separately authorized Qwen4 work."
  ],
